    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "BCPA\nLEADS THE WAY\nACROSS THE PACIFIC WITH\nTHE\nDouglas\nIC6\nBritish Commonwealth Pacific Airlines Sel",
      "mosT Flight-Tested\nAIRLINER NOW FLYING!\nA distance equal to 24 times around the world - that's the\namazing pre-service flight-test record of the DC-6 — newest\nand finest Douglas of them all!\nThe magnificent teamwork of Douglas and leading airlines\nmade it possible to perfect this airplane. Douglas engineers\n- 1200 of them - and airline experts began and stuck to\nthe most exhaustive and unusual flight-proving program\never experienced by an airliner.\nAll told, the DC-6 embodies millions of man-hours on the\npart of Douglas engineers, technicians and craftsmen. Over\n2000 hours were devoted to flight tests alone. And months\nwere spent by airline personnel testing the DC-6, under all\noperating conditions, over the routes it now flies com-\nmercially.\nYet, our responsibility for the DC-6 here at Douglas is just\nbeginning. As with the other great Douglas airplanes the\nDC-3s and DC-4s - we shall\ncontinue at all times to work\nclosely with the airlines on all\nproblems of operation main-\ntenance and service in the\nfield.\n-BRITISH COMMONWEALTH\nCRUISING SPEED MORE THAN 300 MPH. AVERAGE\nRANGE - 2000 MILES WITH FULL PAYLOAD OF OVER\n14,000 POUNDS. MAINTAINS FLIGHT ON ANY TWO EN-\nGINES. COMPLETE AIRCONDITIONING, RADIANT HEAT-\nING, AUTOMATICALLY \"PRESSURIZED\" CABIN AT ALL\nALTITUDES.\nDOUGLAS\nDouglas Aircraft Co., Inc., Santa Monica, Calif., U.S.A."
    ],
